{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 26,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As snow in summer, and as rain in harvest; so honor is not seemly for a fool.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As the bird by wandering, as the swallow by flying, so the curse causeless shall not come.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A whip for the horse, a bridle for the ass, and a rod for the fool's back.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Answer not a fool according to his folly, lest thou also be like him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Answer a fool according to his folly, lest he be wise in his own conceit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that sendeth a message by the hand of a fool cutteth off the feet, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " drinketh damage.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The legs of the lame are not equal: so ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a parable in the mouth of fools.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As he that bindeth a stone in a sling, so ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that giveth honor to a fool.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a thorn goeth up into the hand of a drunkard, so ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a parable in the mouth of fools.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The great ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "God",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " that formed all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "things",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " both rewardeth the fool, and rewardeth transgressors.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As a dog returneth to his vomit, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a fool returneth to his folly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Seest thou a man wise in his own conceit? ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " more hope of a fool than of him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The slothful ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " saith, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "There is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a lion in the way; a lion ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the streets.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the door turneth upon its hinges, so ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "doth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the slothful upon his bed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The slothful hideth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hand in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " bosom; it grieveth him to bring it again to his mouth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sluggard ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wiser in his own conceit than seven men that can render a reason.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that passeth by, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " meddleth with strife ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "belonging",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not to him, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is like",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " one that taketh a dog by the ears.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As a mad ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " who casteth fire-brands, arrows, and death,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " deceiveth his neighbor, and saith, Am not I in sport?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Where no wood is, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the fire goeth out: so where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no tale-bearer, the strife ceaseth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " coals ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to burning coals, and wood to fire; so ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a contentious man to kindle strife.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The words of a tale-bearer ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as wounds, and they go down into the innermost parts of the belly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Burning lips and a wicked heart ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are like",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a potsherd covered with silver dross.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that hateth dissembleth with his lips, and layeth up deceit within him;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When he speaketh fair, believe him not: for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " seven abominations in his heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whose",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hatred is covered by deceit, his wickedness shall be shown before the ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "whole",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " congregation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoever diggeth a pit shall fall into it: and he that rolleth a stone, it will return upon him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.26.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.26.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A lying tongue hateth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "those that are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " afflicted by it; and a flattering mouth worketh ruin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
